# Ignore everything in /docs EXCEPT markdown, which is the project record:
# audit reports, phase plans, and the test-suite baseline that gates merges.
# Note: this must exclude the directory *contents* (/docs/*), not the directory
# itself (/docs) — git does not descend into an excluded directory, so a
# negation under it would never be evaluated.
/docs/*
!/docs/*.md
/landing

/WhatsMe
/release
/Chat-Agent-App

# Local agent/tool configuration. .claude/settings.json was tracked as an empty
# file and later filled in locally with a live ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — the key was
# revoked and never reached a commit, but the only reason it did not was that
# nobody ran `git add -A` while it sat in the working tree. These files hold
# credentials and machine-specific paths; they must never be tracked again.
.claude/
